  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Smart oceans and seas (SO) permit the use of telecommunications or information and communication technologies to conserve and sustainably use the oceans, seas and marine resources. Recommendation ITU-T Y.4004 provides an overview of SO and specifies high-level requirements for their implementation. SO use cases are also provided in an appendix.</abstract>
